  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa Trade Facilitation Programme (TFWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall objective is to contribute to the strengthening of the ECOWAS common marketand the integration of the West African region into the international economic and tradingsystems.Specific objectives:1. Improved trade facilitation measures at the regional and national levels consistent withECOWAS and WTO TFA commitments implemented2. Increased efficiency of trade corridors between West African countries</narrative>
